///Remove Payment Plugin:

1. Login WordPress Admin Dashboard (localhost/ecomwordpress/wp-admin)
2. click on "Plugins" --> Paperless Payment
3. Deactive --> Delete

///Install Payment Plugin:
Step-1
----------
Download Payment Plugin:
1. Download and put in Download Folder

Step-2
----------
Install:
1. Login WordPress Admin Dashboard (localhost/ecomwordpress/wp-admin)
2. click on "Plugins" --> Add Plugin --> Upload Plugin --> Browse --> select Payment Plugin
3. Install --> Active

Step-3
----------
Set muid, app key:
1. in Dashboard, click on "Payment"
